{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Bouw een zelfstandig Shopify AI-blok voor Susan’s Aspen Boutique: een schermbrede fotoreviewcarousel. Lever volledige Liquid, CSS, JavaScript en een geldig schema met alle instellingen.
    
    EDITOR EN REVIEWGEGEVENS
    Maak acht afzonderlijke reviewgroepen direct in block.settings. Per groep: ingeschakeld (standaard alle acht aan), foto, foto-uitlijning boven/midden/onder, reviewtekst en score 1–5 met stap 0.5, inclusief 4.5. Gebruik stabiele unieke review-ID’s.
    Een ingeschakelde review blijft meetellen wanneer foto of tekst nog leeg is. Uitschakelen mag inhoud van andere reviews niet verschuiven. Verzin geen klantreviews.
    Maak ook titel, beoordelingslabel, algemene score, reviewaantaltekst, kleuren, tekst-/stergroottes, kaartbreedtes, tussenruimte en sectiepadding instelbaar.
    
    STIJL EN KOP
    Themafont. Achtergrond #F2F2F2, witte kaarten, tekst #111, gouden sterren #FFD21C. Sectie boven/onder 28px ruimte.
    Gecentreerde titel “HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY”, desktop 30px/mobiel 18px, gewicht 500. Indien nodig twee evenwichtige regels, niets afkappen.
    Daaronder “Excellent 4.7/5” naast vijf sterren. Tekst 16px, sterren 24px. Algemene score 1–5, stap 0.1; altijd decimale punt en /5 tonen.
    Daaronder bewerkbare reviewaantaltekst, verborgen indien leeg. Tussen regels 8px, tot kaarten 20px. Mobiele kop 16px zijruimte.
    
    LAYOUT
    Desktop vanaf 990px: carousel schermbreed van links naar rechts, zonder beperkende max-width/page-width of grote zijmarges. Kaarten standaard 400px inclusief padding, instelbaar 320–500px; gap 20px. Gebruik vaste flex-basis en flex-shrink:0. Nooit alle acht kaarten verkleinen om ze tegelijk te tonen.
    Mobiel onder 750px: kaartbreedte 88% van zichtbare carousel, instelbaar 75–94%; gap 12px. Actieve kaart gecentreerd, buurkaart deels zichtbaar. Tablet: 360px.
    Meet vanuit zichtbare carouselviewport, nooit totale track/scrollWidth. Geen horizontale paginaoverflow, sticky/fixed of overlap. Verticaal paginascrollen blijft normaal.
    
    KAARTEN
    Rand 1px #DEDEDE, radius 12px, padding 12px, border-box, geen schaduw. Volgorde: vierkante foto, gecentreerde sterrenrij, gecentreerde tekst.
    Tekst mobiel 16px/desktop 17px, line-height 1.45. Sterren 20px, gap 4px, boven/onder 12px ruimte. Natuurlijke hoogte, geen grote vaste hoogte.
    Fotowrapper relatief, aspect-ratio:1/1, overflow:hidden, radius 9px. Foto vult alleen deze wrapper met object-fit:cover en gekozen object-position. Gebruik echte src/srcset, ook op loopkopieën. Geen actieve-slide-afhankelijke zichtbaarheid.
    Zonder foto: vierkante grijze placeholder met icoon 32px. Foto en inhoud bewegen samen.
    
    STERREN
    Precies vijf sterren per beoordeling op één rij. 4.5 = vier volle en één halve; 4.7 = vier volle en één 70% gevulde. Rest lichtgrijs. Vulling per ster berekenen. SVG/clip-ID’s uniek per blok, kaartkopie en ster.
    
    NAVIGATIE: ACHT ZICHTBARE STIPPEN
    Gebruik één lijst met originele ingeschakelde reviews als bron voor navigatie. Acht ingeschakeld = exact acht stippen, ook als inhoud nog leeg is. Zeven ingeschakeld = zeven. Loopkopieën tellen nooit mee.
    Toon alle stippen tegelijk in een horizontale flexrij. Geen absolute positionering, overlap, verborgen inactieve stippen of afsnijden.
    Stipknoppen exact 9×9px inclusief zwarte rand 1.5px; border-box, min-width:9px, padding:0, radius:50%, flex-shrink:0. Actief zwart gevuld, overige transparant. Gap 10px. Precies één actief.
    Pijlen als SVG, geen teksttekens: 12px breed, 20px hoog, viewBox="0 0 12 20". Links polyline "10,2 2,10 10,18"; rechts "2,2 10,10 2,18". Geen fill, zwarte stroke 2px, ronde lijnuiteinden. SVG display:block en flex-shrink:0.
    Pijlknoppen 40×40px, padding:0, transparant, geen rand/schaduw; icoon gecentreerd.
    Hele navigatie 20px onder kaarten, flex, align-items:center, justify-content:center, nowrap. Gap tussen pijlknoppen en stippencontainer 2px. Zo staan iconen circa 16px van de buitenste stippen. Alles op dezelfde middenlijn, ook mobiel.
    Pijlen gaan één review verder/terug. Stip kiest dichtstbijzijnde exemplaar van bijbehorende review. Toegankelijke labels en toetsenbordbediening.
    
    ONEINDIGE LOOP
    Handmatige swipe/pijlen/stippen, geen autoplay. Na laatste direct eerste, ook andersom, zonder leeg einde of zichtbare terugreis.
    Eén native horizontale flex-scrollcontainer met gecentreerde scroll-snap. Maak voldoende kopieën aan beide kanten om viewport te vullen. Start eerste originele review gecentreerd in middelste reeks.
    Na scroll-einde onzichtbaar naar identieke positie in middelste reeks corrigeren, tijdelijk zonder smooth scrolling/snap. Onderbreek geen actieve swipe. Geen tweede translateX-mechanisme.
    Kopieën delen oorspronkelijke review-ID en activeren dezelfde stip, maar krijgen unieke DOM-ID’s; aria-hidden en niet focusbaar.
    
    STABILITEIT EN CONTROLE
    Scrollhandler werkt alleen actieve stip bij; geen voortdurend scrollTo. Loopcorrectie na scroll-einde beschermen tegen herhaling.
    Herbereken bij breedtewijziging met behoud actieve review, niet bij alleen mobiele hoogtewijziging. Ruim listeners/kopieën 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:{{ block.settings.background }}; color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}; padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 0; overflow:hidden; font-family:{{ settings.type_base_font_family.family }}, sans-serif; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}, .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { max-width:900px; padding:0 16px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center; font-family:{{ settings.type_header_font_family.family }}, sans-serif; font-size:30px; line-height:1.2; font-weight:500; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary { display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-top:8px; font-size:16px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__score { white-space:nowrap; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count { text-align:center; margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { display:flex; gap:{{ block.settings.card_gap }}px; overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:hidden; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scroll-behavior:smooth; scrollbar-width:none; padding:20px max(16px, calc((100vw - {{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}px) / 2)); touch-action:pan-x pan-y; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards::-webkit-scrollbar { display:none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex:0 0 {{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}px; width:{{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}px; border:1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius:12px; padding:12px; background:{{ block.settings.card_color }}; scroll-snap-align:center; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image { position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; overflow:hidden; border-radius:9px; background:#e5e5e5; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { display:block; width:32px; height:32px; color:#777; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:4px; margin:12px 0; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star { display:block; width:20px; height:20px; flex:0 0 20px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text { margin:0; text-align:center; font-size:17px; line-height:1.45; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav { display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:2px; margin-top:20px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { display:flex; flex:0 0 40px; width:40px; height:40px; padding:0; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border:0; background:transparent; color:#111; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg { display:block; flex-shrink:0; width:12px; height:20px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { display:flex; flex:0 1 auto; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot { display:block; flex:0 0 9px; width:9px; min-width:9px; height:9px; padding:0; border:1.5px solid #111; border-radius:50%; background:transparent; cursor:pointer; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot[aria-current="true"] { background:#111; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} button:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #111; outline-offset:3px; }
  @media(max-width:989px) and (min-width:750px) { .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:360px; width:360px; } }
  @media(max-width:749px) {
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { padding:0 16px; font-size:18px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards { gap:12px; padding:20px 6vw; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { flex-basis:{{ block.settings.mobile_card_percent }}vw; width:{{ block.settings.mobile_card_percent }}vw; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text { font-size:16px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { gap:8px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { flex-basis:34px; width:34px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-review-carousel {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <h2 class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
  <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary">
    <span>{{ block.settings.rating_label | escape }} {{ block.settings.overall_score }}<span aria-hidden="true">/5</span><span class="visually-hidden"> out of 5</span></span>
    <span class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars" aria-label="{{ block.settings.overall_score }} out of 5 stars">
      {% for star in (1..5) %}{% assign fill_pct = block.settings.overall_score | minus: forloop.index0 | times: 100 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100 %}<svg class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="{{ ai_gen_id }}-summary-{{ forloop.index }}"><stop offset="{{ fill_pct }}%" stop-color="{{ block.settings.star_color }}"/><stop offset="{{ fill_pct }}%" stop-color="#d7d7d7"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="url(#{{ ai_gen_id }}-summary-{{ forloop.index }})" d="m12 1.8 3.1 6.3 7 .0-5.2 4.8 1.4 7-6.3-3.5-6.3 3.5 1.4-7L1.9 8.1h7z"/></svg>{% endfor %}
    </span>
  </div>
  {% if block.settings.review_count != blank %}<div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count">{{ block.settings.review_count | escape }}</div>{% endif %}
  <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cards" data-track aria-label="Customer reviews" tabindex="0">
    {% for i in (1..8) %}
      {% assign enabled_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_enabled' %}{% assign photo_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_photo' %}{% assign align_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_alignment' %}{% assign text_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_text' %}{% assign rating_key = 'review_' | append: i | append: '_rating' %}
      {% if block.settings[enabled_key] %}
        {% assign review_id = 'review-' | append: i %}{% assign rating = block.settings[rating_key] %}
        <article class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" data-original data-review-id="{{ review_id }}" data-rating="{{ rating }}" aria-label="Review {{ i }}">
          <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">
            {% if block.settings[photo_key] %}{% assign pos = block.settings[align_key] %}<img src="{{ block.settings[photo_key] | image_url: width: 900 }}" srcset="{{ block.settings[photo_key] | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ block.settings[photo_key] | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w, {{ block.settings[photo_key] | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w" sizes="(max-width: 749px) 88vw, 400px" alt="{{ block.settings[photo_key].alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" style="object-position:center {{ pos }};">{% else %}<div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars" role="img" aria-label="{{ rating }} out of 5 stars">
            {% for star in (1..5) %}{% assign fill_pct = rating | minus: forloop.index0 | times: 100 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100 %}<svg class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ review_id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><stop offset="{{ fill_pct }}%" stop-color="{{ block.settings.star_color }}"/><stop offset="{{ fill_pct }}%" stop-color="#d7d7d7"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="url(#{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ review_id }}-{{ forloop.index }})" d="m12 1.8 3.1 6.3 7 .0-5.2 4.8 1.4 7-6.3-3.5-6.3 3.5 1.4-7L1.9 8.1h7z"/></svg>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings[text_key] != blank %}<p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__text">{{ block.settings[text_key] | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <nav class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Review carousel navigation" data-nav>
    <button class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous review"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 20" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="10,2 2,10 10,18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
    <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots" data-dots></div>
    <button class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next review"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 20" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="2,2 10,10 2,18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
  </nav>
</review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(() => {
  const tag = 'review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
  if (customElements.get(tag)) return;
  class ReviewCarousel extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      this.track = this.querySelector('[data-track]');
      this.dotsBox = this.querySelector('[data-dots]');
      this.originals = Array.from(this.track.querySelectorAll('[data-original]'));
      this.active = 0;
      this.timer = null;
      this.onScroll = this.onScroll.bind(this);
      this.track.addEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll, { passive: true });
      this.querySelector('[data-prev]').addEventListener('click', () => this.go(this.active - 1));
      this.querySelector('[data-next]').addEventListener('click', () => this.go(this.active + 1));
      this.makeDots();
      if (this.originals.length > 1) this.buildLoop();
      this.resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => this.rebuild());
      this.resizeObserver.observe(this.track);
      requestAnimationFrame(() => this.centerInitial());
    }
    disconnectedCallback() {
      this.track?.removeEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll);
      this.resizeObserver?.disconnect();
      clearTimeout(this.timer);
    }
    makeDots() {
      this.dotsBox.replaceChildren();
      this.originals.forEach((slide, index) => {
        const button = document.createElement('button');
        button.type = 'button'; button.className = 'ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot';
        button.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Go to review ' + (index + 1));
        button.addEventListener('click', () => this.go(index));
        this.dotsBox.append(button);
      });
      this.updateDots();
    }
    buildLoop() {
      this.track.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(node => node.remove());
      const copies = Math.max(2, Math.ceil(this.track.clientWidth / Math.max(1, this.originals[0].getBoundingClientRect().width + this.gap())) + 1);
      const before = document.createDocumentFragment(), after = document.createDocumentFragment();
      for (let n = 0; n < copies; n++) {
        this.originals.slice().reverse().forEach((item, index) => before.append(this.clone(item, 'before-' + n + '-' + index)));
        this.originals.forEach((item, index) => after.append(this.clone(item, 'after-' + n + '-' + index)));
      }
      this.track.prepend(before); this.track.append(after);
      this.copySets = copies;
      this.snapStart = copies * this.originals.length;
    }
    clone(item, suffix) {
      const clone = item.cloneNode(true); clone.removeAttribute('data-original'); clone.dataset.copy = 'true'; clone.dataset.copyKey = suffix;
      clone.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true'); clone.querySelectorAll('a,button,input,select,textarea,[tabindex]').forEach(el => el.setAttribute('tabindex', '-1'));
      clone.querySelectorAll('[id]').forEach(el => el.id += '-' + suffix);
      clone.querySelectorAll('linearGradient').forEach(el => el.id += '-' + suffix);
      clone.querySelectorAll('[fill^="url(#"]').forEach(el => el.setAttribute('fill', el.getAttribute('fill').replace(/url\(#([^)]*)\)/, 'url(#$1-' + suffix + ')')));
      return clone;
    }
    gap() { return parseFloat(getComputedStyle(this.track).columnGap) || 0; }
    centerInitial() { if (this.originals.length) this.goToPhysical(this.snapStart, false); }
    go(index) {
      const count = this.originals.length; if (!count) return;
      const normalized = (index % count + count) % count; this.active = normalized; this.updateDots();
      const target = this.snapStart + normalized;
      const nearby = Array.from(this.track.children).filter(el => el.dataset.reviewId === this.originals[normalized].dataset.reviewId);
      let chosen = nearby[0], best = Infinity;
      nearby.forEach(el => { const distance = Math.abs(el.getBoundingClientRect().left - this.track.getBoundingClientRect().left); if (distance < best) {best = distance; chosen = el;} });
      if (chosen) this.scrollCentered(chosen, true);
    }
    goToPhysical(index, smooth) { const el = this.track.children[index]; if (el) this.scrollCentered(el, smooth); }
    scrollCentered(el, smooth) { const left = el.offsetLeft - (this.track.clientWidth - el.offsetWidth) / 2; this.track.scrollTo({left, behavior: smooth ? 'smooth' : 'instant'}); }
    onScroll() {
      if (this.adjusting || !this.originals.length) return;
      const center = this.track.getBoundingClientRect().left + this.track.clientWidth / 2;
      let best = Infinity, found = 0;
      Array.from(this.track.children).forEach(el => { const distance = Math.abs(el.getBoundingClientRect().left + el.offsetWidth / 2 - center); if (distance < best) { best = distance; found = this.originals.findIndex(orig => orig.dataset.reviewId === el.dataset.reviewId); } });
      if (found >= 0 && found !== this.active) { this.active = found; this.updateDots(); }
      clearTimeout(this.timer); this.timer = setTimeout(() => this.correctLoop(), 180);
    }
    updateDots() { Array.from(this.dotsBox.children).forEach((dot, i) => { if (i === this.active) dot.setAttribute('aria-current', 'true'); else dot.removeAttribute('aria-current'); }); }
    correctLoop() {
      if (!this.originals.length || this.originals.length < 2) return;
      const children = Array.from(this.track.children); const center = this.track.getBoundingClientRect().left + this.track.clientWidth / 2;
      let nearest = null, dist = Infinity;
      children.forEach(el => { const d = Math.abs(el.getBoundingClientRect().left + el.offsetWidth / 2 - center); if (d < dist) {dist = d; nearest = el;} });
      const idx = children.indexOf(nearest); const start = this.snapStart; const end = start + this.originals.length;
      if (idx >= start && idx < end) return;
      const matching = Array.from(this.track.children).filter(el => el.dataset.reviewId === nearest.dataset.reviewId && children.indexOf(el) >= start && children.indexOf(el) < end);
      if (matching[0]) { this.adjusting = true; this.track.style.scrollSnapType = 'none'; this.track.style.scrollBehavior = 'auto'; this.scrollCentered(matching[0], false); requestAnimationFrame(() => { this.track.style.scrollSnapType = ''; this.track.style.scrollBehavior = ''; this.adjusting = false; }); }
    }
    rebuild() {
      const key = this.originals[this.active]?.dataset.reviewId; this.adjusting = true;
      if (this.originals.length > 1) this.buildLoop();
      this.snapStart = this.originals.length > 1 ? this.copySets * this.originals.length : 0;
      const target = key ? Array.from(this.track.children).find(el => el.dataset.reviewId === key && !el.dataset.copy) : null;
      if (target) { this.track.style.scrollSnapType = 'none'; this.scrollCentered(target, false); requestAnimationFrame(() => { this.track.style.scrollSnapType = ''; this.adjusting = false; }); }
      else this.adjusting = false;
    }
  }
  customElements.define(tag, ReviewCarousel);
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Photo review carousel",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"text","id":"title","label":"Title","default":"HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY"},
    {"type":"text","id":"rating_label","label":"Rating label","default":"Excellent"},
    {"type":"range","id":"overall_score","label":"Overall score","min":1,"max":5,"step":0.1,"default":4.7},
    {"type":"text","id":"review_count","label":"Review count text","default":"Based on customer reviews"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Section style"},
    {"type":"color","id":"background","label":"Background","default":"#F2F2F2"},
    {"type":"color","id":"card_color","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFFFF"},
    {"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#111111"},
    {"type":"color","id":"star_color","label":"Star color","default":"#FFD21C"},
    {"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Card border","default":"#DEDEDE"},
    {"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":0,"max":60,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":28},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_card_width","label":"Desktop card width","min":320,"max":500,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":400},
    {"type":"range","id":"mobile_card_percent","label":"Mobile card width","min":75,"max":95,"step":1,"unit":"%","default":88},
    {"type":"range","id":"card_gap","label":"Desktop card gap","min":10,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":20},
    {"type":"header","content":"Review 1"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_1_enabled","label":"Enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_1_photo","label":"Photo"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_1_alignment","label":"Photo alignment","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Middle"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_1_text","label":"Review text"},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_1_rating","label":"Score","min":1,"max":5,"step":0.5,"default":5},
    {"type":"header","content":"Review 2"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_2_enabled","label":"Enabled","default":true},
    {"type":"image_picker","id":"review_2_photo","label":"Photo"},
    {"type":"select","id":"review_2_alignment","label":"Photo alignment","options":[{"value":"top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center","label":"Middle"},{"value":"bottom","label":"Bottom"}],"default":"center"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"review_2_text","label":"Review text"},
    {"type":"range","id":"review_2_rating","label":"Score","min":1,"max":5,"step":0.5,"default":5},
    {"type":"header","content":"Review 3"},
    {"type":"checkbox","id":"review_3_enabled","label":"Enabled","default":true},
